        "event_id": "lite_evt_00557",
        "explanation": "Caregiver demonstrated receipt of the plan, red flags, medications, and follow-up framing.",
        "quote": "先按这个方案在家观察"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode ended with a clear home-observation and follow-up plan: continue iron and vitamin D, follow up in about one week with blood count/bilirubin, and use emergency care for red flags. The last caregiver message was a teach-back and confirmation request rather than a new unsafe issue; although the medication-restart warning gap remains, the closure itself was otherwise traceable and actionable.",
