          "explanation": "Caregiver later repeated the final home observation, medications, follow-up, and emergency plan.",
          "quote": "叫不醒、吃奶明显变差"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Although the doctor did not use a formal teach-back prompt every time, the caregiver repeatedly restated the red flags, medications to continue, follow-up timing, and escalation owner, and the doctor confirmed understanding before the terminal phase.",
